kout iframe</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"d323e6d2b621\"><p local-id=\"5d84b45cdc5a\">Hardi</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"bee2238b915b\"><p local-id=\"3d68a4d5b579\">A Zimmermann-specific implementation details, so we can get details like the <code>frame-src</code> (for CSP, for different environments if applicable), <code>postMessage</code> schema etc.</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"32b30f2e276a\"><p local-id=\"cded31b5c432\"></p></td><td ac:local-id=\"24416ffd6a50\"><p local-id=\"ab9fa90ff4d4\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"183c026a9961\"><td ac:local-id=\"c7079f0e88c5\"><p local-id=\"447a6d489fa8\">Q2</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"c02549977d4a\"><p local-id=\"ffde75d229e3\">SFCC</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"73bf868f9b75\"><p local-id=\"387eeed096cc\">Retail Rewards redemption at Checkout</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"fe46d2552592\"><p local-id=\"97b91b34f0c2\">Jasmijn</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"da825356c411\"><p local-id=\"5be0a62e34f2\">Confirm whether global-e can support AP21 retail rewards redemption in international checkouts - limitation today</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"a52cd27bcfc0\"><p local-id=\"1ecbb2711fe0\">Medium</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"e2ba0bd28ff1\"><p local-id=\"07520dba2321\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"da6ab3b02422\"><td ac:local-id=\"9e6a5e4ada46\"><p local-id=\"68d1f805b5cd\">Q3</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"2f7e1bed802a\"><p local-id=\"991938da2537\">SFCC</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"dfcdc55a53f5\"><p local-id=\"1fc8a5d627b1\">Shipping Country lock at Checkout</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"5fc8285cd6d5\"><p local-id=\"52f8d4777bd2\">Jasmijn</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"a83c8d3f5c94\"><p local-id=\"74483871736e\">Confirm whether global-e locks shipping country in Checkout (The requirement is: The system will lock the shipping country in the Global-e checkout for international orders. The shipping country is determined by the customer's country selector selection prior to checkout entry and cannot be changed within the Global-e checkout flow. To change their shipping country, the customer must return to the storefront and update their country selector selection.) </p></td><td ac:local-id=\"a9e89218acec\"><p local-id=\"7a2d1ecf8345\">Medium</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"25332fce64f3\"><p local-id=\"5775c495df3e\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"bd58b23145ab\"><td ac:local-id=\"6e879f446496\"><p local-id=\"ed1d7d5169fd\">Q4</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"08edad842db6\"><p local-id=\"7b8176ea9e39\"></p></td><td ac:local-id=\"31d8ada780c4\"><p local-id=\"fde20e135712\"></p></td><td ac:local-id=\"096eda580a3d\"><p local-id=\"33851951aaa0\"></p></td><td ac:local-id=\"df7e9b5b9821\"><p local-id=\"356b811fc323\"></p></td><td ac:local-id=\"fe5c20ee500a\"><p local-id=\"81f2dada4055\"></p></td><td ac:local-id=\"10839b988ccf\"><p local-id=\"66ef9952f230\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
